The Wigner 3j / 6j / 9j coefficient routines in this directory (c/wig/) are an
original implementation by F. Sasaki. The original code was written in Fortran;
it was later translated to C via f2c and then refactored into modern C while
preserving bit-exact agreement with the original Fortran output.

